msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a51aa466e3cbecb5e55cf18998a35862af0b9d6f35e727889af5d61983b0dcd5
#. default-sha256: 678465c056956c6fdc2b41f321ccca8a525993b14f12a1adad750b1d9638ef9d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am, even now, putting her through a harrowing experience.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Digging up the memories "
"she locked away,⟪k:3⟫the past she wanted to pretend never happened,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は今も、⟪k:1⟫彼女に対して酷なことをしている。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女が否定したい過去を、⟪k:4⟫思い出"
"したくないものを――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04c7e5be4680e1712e6dd60c4f5ab3d27e629be74b9cf708661cdf0d24768931
#. default-sha256: 1da8323361a41aaa9f38e8ccbaa6aaddf8a3fef5dbd0213444745f77cffeb2b8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ get her back to who she once was... ⟪k:3⟫even if means forcing her to "
"endure this."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど……、⟪k:1⟫そうしてでも……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私は彼女を取り戻さなければならない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8572E743_F1B9_4725_83AC_301F6C7F53F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cdfe785d767f53ed2cab351ec23ff2263fb24cd1312aa1556dd3fe4286e5767
#. default-sha256: 755111171453215da3f84fff0b9026237ad0a5a7d9b24366fb24ee3b17ffb1d3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8572E743_F1B9_4725_83AC_301F6C7F53F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ remember everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫すべてを、⟪k:1⟫思い出してもらわなければならない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BE807F3_EF9C_4755_8CDA_4DB5B59BF213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e64164de1bf2788d55b0265e5937a82de87b8f9d5ad0e6ad4f8bf0ed12c68ed0
#. default-sha256: 4fb66c617dc4860f4912395d85ec13a0c9075a4f4cfdae8311341bda9461e3ba
