msgid "⟪k:0⟫There’s still more we need to see, though,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……けれど、⟪k:1⟫まだ終わりには出来ない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_433AD9C5_8D01_4816_9DFA_2A7298F26081
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f23886a22b60f6d4047d06a566dcbcd14bc7b1615f50457211ccee9b4679fe3
