#: scenario5:scenario5_C060641D_4200_474C_9BD0_D89E2D008FCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dff42a1d81ff3ee1d030ebc7a3378b9dfbdebabaff6b1d90be369906a52339cd
