"foreigners."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫まさに、⟪k:1⟫今の首都に似た様相さ。⟪k:2⟫いいや――首都よりも異邦人に扉を開いていたのかもね。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_94A85F03_4F3D_42CC_94C6_F0FC1D1FA8EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01babde81b9ff1720eff8451eb4299fc8d9ba438f36ed4b61a2197ca46e0f2f8
#. default-sha256: fd0f6c24898e2d0372d3ad521c93f00448c68cbe23015c0bb35d54c8e6f3bc73
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94A85F03_4F3D_42CC_94C6_F0FC1D1FA8EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what happens when a place is wiped from history.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I couldn’t tell you how "
"reliable the tablets are,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫歴史から葬り去られた街だよ。⟪k:1⟫まあ、⟪k:2⟫残されていた資料がどれほど正しいのか、⟪k:3⟫僕には"
"分からないけれど――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DCB8A0FE_8FC7_433B_A4F5_85816AD8B2FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c7ebe8b51f73866d316b42cf2a6c720cc4ef9072fb09e8bb092cfd3be97c957
#. default-sha256: a94c4536ecebebbfc7977ff23d280f18bbc4fed2e2cc8524a1db5707bf65f15c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DCB8A0FE_8FC7_433B_A4F5_85816AD8B2FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but if you take them at their word,⟪k:1⟫this city lost everything in just a single week."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それを鵜呑みにするならば、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫その街はたった一週間ですべてを失っていった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_01E120F0_5D86_4DBE_8874_E0BBDAE99807
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 388cc02d647ea05b3ce6a637b68ef97ce4b9111da0693ebe35c074dadde26067
#. default-sha256: 9e8871373287c15925346c076f96444b3984eba9bc027cf2d1d5387a21afdef7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_01E120F0_5D86_4DBE_8874_E0BBDAE99807"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫え………？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6B93008A_EC60_4FA0_B00D_41BDD9715DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e89bc4e3fca35806f9ada602a01bba31cbdfc0911e6dae6138d4aa5b6b8fa150
#. default-sha256: 014f7e180a009d79f0f9eda8f8694cd527cb148f055c94c2fea9f99fab80b808
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6B93008A_EC60_4FA0_B00D_41BDD9715DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People, crops, livestock, all dead.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maybe it was a natural disaster, a famine, a "
"plague—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can’t say for sure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人も、⟪k:1⟫作物も、⟪k:2⟫家畜も。⟪k:3⟫死に絶えていったんだ。⟪k:4⟫天災か、⟪k:5⟫飢饉か、⟪k:6⟫疫"
"病か――真相は分からない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_117F95DD_3C55_4F03_ABF0_59459188078A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5eda2da7f2f477bd464a37ed349ae11c3f5e9e9523c78cedda50886ec76c2540
#. default-sha256: b6e53b1e06ab47c76b81662ac9e4a605128f89e1b4e334eabd5d5bd0a36d3965
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_117F95DD_3C55_4F03_ABF0_59459188078A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This is what the tablets said, though:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど人はこう呼んだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9A84221_0EC5_406E_8208_5C64ADD6A369
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc3430fd2dde417fa7d98fec19a1fb97a89a9560e8c2191708adf51c65bfdf32
#. default-sha256: 0192bfad64b1e04c7f823ed8ded086625c41636356ad49aa1ab7abe47b037530
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9A84221_0EC5_406E_8208_5C64ADD6A369"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cursed... ⟪k:3⟫by the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……魔女の、⟪k:3⟫呪い……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_60EC949C_4071_48D2_B958_B5D71D85B43E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb6c98a48eb04a6eb1603a5e188a2ab495e9126e28f3c035ecf2db39897ca138
#. default-sha256: c1ce6458cafadba5e409e99143f912557e1de35e28f994fdc12cf2e6d76356a0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_60EC949C_4071_48D2_B958_B5D71D85B43E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Look over there. You see that river?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There used to be a magnificent bridge crossing "
"it,⟪k:3⟫but there’s hardly anything left of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ごらん、⟪k:1⟫あの川の向こうを。⟪k:2⟫かつてはあの川にも立派な橋がかかっていたそうだけどね、"
"⟪k:3⟫今は見る影もない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FFD4F708_AFC7_4C14_B632_0ECFC247B945
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01d1bfa1a69549baa68176f070d595de23df0a7563c30a72ca38646b6c4b19af
#. default-sha256: 7601fed67978f46219055167969e453fcee5350f80b49b6d21a901de68b79053
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FFD4F708_AFC7_4C14_B632_0ECFC247B945"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The deeper parts of the forest are so dense you can’t see anything but tree trunks and "
"leaves. It’s an eerie place, wrapped in a cloud of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫奥の方まで踏み込めば、⟪k:1⟫濃い樹木が目の前を覆い隠す、⟪k:2⟫薄気味悪い森だよ。⟪k:3⟫鬱蒼と茂る"
"闇の森……と言うべきかな。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_73D700D3_E82C_41C4_88AA_A2945784D3AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73D700D3_E82C_41C4_88AA_A2945784D3AB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6FC3B647_77D4_416C_8EDA_DBCDDDB59CCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e15b409fe67cab7e1f59c7c8e386aa51bf1bd987b0217a5b77a53c1bb042f69f
#. default-sha256: a084efa0f962b1a44685ad18fb86008a8f13ba5567be8249860b0014daf02bf3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6FC3B647_77D4_416C_8EDA_DBCDDDB59CCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The city was so large that the mansion was actually in its borders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My guess is the "
"bridge was built to mark the road leading to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫かつての街は、⟪k:1⟫あの館も飲み込むほどの規模があったそうだ。⟪k:2⟫川にかけられた橋は、⟪k:3⟫館"
"への道も示していたのだろうな。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_051B9A84_0600_41B1_95E8_D61DE028237E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 508b8d69814066240b6aff690bb0e4e8030db00a884ce705972caebce1242296
#. default-sha256: cbe0470f2567c3b8f43f073a35c9e763680f2095f1558d515738e71e84dbf149
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_051B9A84_0600_41B1_95E8_D61DE028237E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The witch living in the mansion goes by the name Morgana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫According to the records, "
"someone by that same name was executed in this area for witchcraft,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――館には、⟪k:1⟫モルガーナが住んでいるんだ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫記録に残る、⟪k:4⟫この土地で処刑された魔"
"女の名だ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CA3AB338_C0EA_43C3_ABD5_6AD6461B8F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06c2139389f8b2815f4087c978243017a02800fc9519dc2d01802c0c0b43f052
#. default-sha256: 1c66cd57a6e59e5029c65c7496b1090783ac210d1f4fd814a88d5f1eb4f7402b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CA3AB338_C0EA_43C3_ABD5_6AD6461B8F5E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and even in death, she continues to bear her grudge against mankind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は、⟪k:1⟫息絶えてもまだ、⟪k:2⟫人々を恨み続けている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_55EDDC48_7963_4D42_A334_C643011CDE3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_55EDDC48_7963_4D42_A334_C643011CDE3C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F4E6C79C_2C08_4AD1_876A_9C16DE88B421
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 331615c16698e71c053205400136a27eb4709397a8da73d59ac38858a9a1a80c
#. default-sha256: 3cce88e83dc229826681861e93706b6facf9762a15ef8b9eebdb7bb0d4a908f0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F4E6C79C_2C08_4AD1_876A_9C16DE88B421"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Who knows how much of it is true, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Truth or fiction, the story has taken "
"root in this region."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――なんて、⟪k:1⟫眉唾ものの話だけどね。⟪k:2⟫それでも、⟪k:3⟫魔女の逸話については、⟪k:4⟫この一帯"
"ではそれなりに有名な話さ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8E6B3BB_0125_4BA0_BD91_686AB139DCB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e70ff9032883434a389523180a4c85421026ce05fc391cd0a6ca469690fe8f0b
#. default-sha256: 7ac1b86bd81e66f29b93ec7df228bf953bd87202cbf60eecb6f02bc9ae926ba1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8E6B3BB_0125_4BA0_BD91_686AB139DCB8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The city’s history may be lost, but the legend of the witch continues to be told. ⟪k:1⟫"
"People have a tendency to keep stories alive that scare them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫街の歴史は葬られたようだけど……、⟪k:1⟫魔女の言い伝えは残ってしまうのだから。⟪k:2⟫とかく人とい"
"うのは、⟪k:3⟫恐ろしいものを伝え続けるものだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A00DB224_71A5_421F_BC40_3C1C64945FBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05690487dc04b7cb76b5667309bbb9309ac51f21bf13eae996485612ef713a52
#. default-sha256: 34c7253dba1506ff860cc24da99223fd3c2db1833f3e6a0a73025f6530dc6faf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A00DB224_71A5_421F_BC40_3C1C64945FBD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫I’m fine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いえ……、⟪k:1⟫大丈夫……です。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_438F3829_68B8_4599_9D7D_4D1794A6D458
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 288af3344c283a09e896e6aa9870dfd81978d9577937265bd74e3ffa705d9aaf
#. default-sha256: 8298f20d173c1ed4c1d048a20e16633425444c9cffdada0013f6246e6e073322
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_438F3829_68B8_4599_9D7D_4D1794A6D458"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Better safe than sorry, if you ask me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aside from the mansion, this is as peaceful "
"a village as you’ll find."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ただの言い伝えだとしても、⟪k:1⟫用心するに越したことはないさ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……館の噂を除けば、"
"⟪k:4⟫この村は平和そのものだよ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2E783A11_1860_446C_A23B_F33F058CE9A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b0cd1fa98b9f194e923dd2aa35201201278df02aae935a622ce24c596895f8e
#. default-sha256: 1ee00abc111bddac6cdf99ce575d342d0acbe1c42f9101bb899512fe0e3769bf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2E783A11_1860_446C_A23B_F33F058CE9A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But I don’t remember any cursed witch.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（でも……、⟪k:1⟫そこに呪われた魔女なんていた？）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1E407112_215F_4868_8D42_B36E72810C7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b60de208c4a973c510f25df869b16434ccc285de3221491f781601296572ebe1
#. default-sha256: 1aa05868d31dee325560318ab8c9ca0b377bb5704e4342898844f86a835d1a58
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1E407112_215F_4868_8D42_B36E72810C7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Maybe the rumors about a witch living there were spread by him—)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（呪われた魔女の噂だって、⟪k:1⟫もしかしたら……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FF59E07_262D_4A5D_A382_0E3E6EF15DDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbf05c52b351d7506435a24eea2ef3fc94f3ddf7938503b0878d41595d85fa56
#. default-sha256: f00c47f051828493e80cd8c8ecb06cb230b776476b22f80321ea9364e1e79966
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FF59E07_262D_4A5D_A382_0E3E6EF15DDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With nowhere else to go, I ended up in this small village.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There was no "
"denying that there was very little to speak of here,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どこにも戻れなくなったわたしが辿り着いた、⟪k:2⟫小さな村。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫そこは確かに、⟪k:5⟫何"
"もなかったけれど――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A19B5A9B_6DEE_40FC_AF38_4A0E1A518C20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a1f8bbfe9fb2a629cdccf8623f12ef49f5ba361fe68b5738a22a41d6afcddd3
#. default-sha256: 361ebe7c9a40cd81aa3fad2a8e8bca22df462a6a4222822aacb3fd2d91d072ab
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A19B5A9B_6DEE_40FC_AF38_4A0E1A518C20"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I found peace in that nothingness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その、⟪k:1⟫何もないこと自体が、⟪k:2⟫わたしにとっては平穏そのものに思えた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_71E64260_D9AD_4229_8124_626865BE8383
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4442a50e5fbdc70cd8a90c1d0c767157ed475dfd25d55681760977b3d3790e3f
#. default-sha256: e629c640fdffa9f2a6bc5571c55e98e203c2aad4ae10d6573cfc2886b2da9536
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_71E64260_D9AD_4229_8124_626865BE8383"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The village ran entirely on its own crops and livestock.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They had no currency, "
"merely bartered among themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫村は農業で成り立っているようなものだった。⟪k:1⟫貨幣も存在せず、⟪k:2⟫必要なものがあれば物々交"
"換で済む世界。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_744C0A19_C457_4F1E_8090_5096CFE69906
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f21d3b2b531d7ccaa559a8d3c4d06dbac96c170af1d6e1bca56ad94deae43e7
#. default-sha256: 5b28dbb78ce13d7badbf3d0560919951e2a6b31781087230b0e169043ef1747e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_744C0A19_C457_4F1E_8090_5096CFE69906"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first I wasn’t sure what to think, being such a departure from my lifestyle in the "
"capital,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしが暮らしていた首都とは大きな違いで、⟪k:1⟫最初こそ戸惑いはしたけれど――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9B22D0FA_8010_4E6D_81E1_2231A65F7478
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50270eabe316ca9747913ef8a037358e314651d5566943a265b099008426afc6
#. default-sha256: 320732ff167532628afeb197cfedcdb3a40dc86c910be17dcc8d889dbe7641e0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9B22D0FA_8010_4E6D_81E1_2231A65F7478"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’mon, Giselle! Come play with us!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫おーい、⟪k:4⟫ジゼルー！　⟪k:5⟫一緒に遊ぼうよー！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F428B08C_BE28_4758_9549_EE5B1DB88942
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab8075333b5d4e0e17c38527fb25f65d9ce43791566169a68c0f36445cc23867
#. default-sha256: 34c7678e20c889c2114654b8fedd9c41beae0819a369dc229cf848d1d883a581
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F428B08C_BE28_4758_9549_EE5B1DB88942"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We’re playing hide-and-seek today!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今日はかくれんぼするんだよー！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9BF69C7_BFBC_48E3_9972_6C6C2E3F4272
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 814a75b492e8479061494ee4b60b8ac80189662306a96d60a227a6b92f811b7e
#. default-sha256: 2e451e5e1bd7612361ce12d1ac44da067605f5c9f8de87a8c3510fe5043fe048
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9BF69C7_BFBC_48E3_9972_6C6C2E3F4272"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Can’t, sorry! I’m spinning yarn."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だーめ！　⟪k:1⟫今はね、⟪k:2⟫糸を作ってるところなんだから。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7B70B7B0_A839_4104_9D42_68A08C8BF4CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
